    "result_text": "The change is complete and the test suite is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe registration-date business-day rule now extends to public holidays. In `RegistrationDate.java` (`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/`) I:\n\n1. Added a fixed `HOLIDAYS` set: `2026-01-01`, `2026-01-26`, `2026-04-25`, `2026-12-25`, `2026-12-28`.\n2. Extended `toBusinessDay(...)` to roll forward while the date is a Saturday, Sunday, **or** a listed holiday \u2014 so it lands on the next non-holiday business day.\n\nThis is the shared helper used by `ApplyRegistrationDate` (stores the date on the owner) and `RequireDailyCapacity` (counts owners per adjusted business day), so both now honor the holiday roll. `BUILD SUCCESS` \u2014 `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`.",
